overlap between Gifts and Skill Tricks. Off course playing into that fkr Talents would've saved alot of time in designing the mechanics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26322,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26322-ryu238","user":"ryu238","date":". 12-19-2024, 01:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26322-ryu238","name":"ryu238","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-23T17:26:04-08:00","id":1547209,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1546490-alot-of-gifts-feel-underpowered?p=1546492#post1546492\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The issue to me is that skill tricks are too powerful. They should be things regular people can do, balanced in level with specialties, not powerful stuff. To me it would be limited to a few effects only:<br /> - 1 enhancement in a general use of the skill<br /> - 1 scale in a very specific situation<br /> - reduce the cost of an specific stunt by 2<br /> - reduce the cost of a small range of complications by 2<br /> <br /> Now on Gifts, some gifts are pretty situational or niche, but if you get into that condition you are king.</div> </div> </div> </div>Have you considered making house rules like the ones in your Powered Inspiration suppliments?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26322-ryu238","name":"ryu238","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-24T04:16:51-08:00","id":1547214,"title":"","content":"I wrote the Skill Tricks rules to add it to House Rules The Basics. It will be in the next update.<br /> <br /> Now on Gifts, I think I could pick the most useful Gifts and turn them into Gifts\u2026 must think a bit about. Maybe even a book just for that as it goes a bit off what I think is the focus of The Basics. But it is worth for sure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-24T14:31:21-08:00","id":1547224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_poste